6th NOV. 1983 BATTERSEA PARK BELGRAVE HARRIERS SENIOR 3000m WALKING CHAMPIONSHIPS

Held in conjunction with the mens championships and a few guests. There was also to be a girls fun walk with opposition from Woking A.C. but unfortunately the opposition did not turn up. Good performances from Rosemary and Kim Marsh.

Senior 3000m:
1.R.Honeychurch 17.35; 2.K.Marsh 20.23; 3.V.Tanner 22.16;

Girls 2000m Walk:
1.R.Parrott 13.09; 2.M.O'Connell 14.46;

Girls 1200m Walk:
1.N.Marsh 8.21; 2.C.Christou 9.19; 3.S.O'Connell 10.09;
